# --- GRAPHIT AUTOGENERATED IGNORER ---
**/.graphit/runtime/
**/.graphit/grammars/
# --- END GRAPHIT AUTOGENERATED IGNORER ---

# The launcher payload is BUILD OUTPUT, not source. The Makefile fetches or builds each
# native into here — liblbug, the httpfs extension, ONNX Runtime, the LanceDB shared
# library — and go:embed pulls them into the launcher binary. Nothing here was ignored
# before, so every one of them showed up as untracked and a `git add -A` after a build
# would have committed hundreds of megabytes of binary. Only .keep belongs to the repo.
cmd/launcher/runtime/*
!cmd/launcher/runtime/.keep

# The LanceDB native, built per platform by `make fetch-lancedb`. 230 MB, never committed.
.native/
